<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>2024·美的集团ESG报告 - 附录</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: #333;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 2320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 60px 30px 60px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .top-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #333;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .top-bar .left {
    color: #333;
  }
  .top-bar .right {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #333;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .top-bar .right .active {
    border: 1px solid #29a3e0;
    color: #29a3e0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 3px 12px;
  }
  .main-title {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .main-title::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -6px;
    left: 0;
    width: 90px;
    height: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #cde9f7, #eef7fc);
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .columns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .col {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .col1 { flex: 1.15; }
  .col2 { flex: 1.15; }
  .col3 { flex: 1.3; }
  .col4 { flex: 1; }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .pill {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1.5px solid #29a3e0;
    color: #29a3e0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 6px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .item {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .item-title {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    display: block;
  }
  .item-source {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #b3b3b3;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #333;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 0 0 20px 0;
  }
  .trophy-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    right: 40px;
    bottom: 0px;
    width: 320px;
    height: 340px;
  }
  .trophy-placeholder .placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #29a3e0;
    font-size: 13px;
    border: 1px dashed #a8d8ef;
    background: #f4fbff;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="top-bar">
    <div class="left">2024·美的集团ESG报告</div>
