      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">全球最佳雇主</span>
        <div class="item-source">福布斯</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">全球最适合女性工作的企业</span>
        <div class="item-source">福布斯</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">全球科技品牌（Technology 100）价值100强，美的排名40</span>
        <div class="item-source">Brand Finance</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">以旧换新领军品牌</span>
        <div class="item-source">人民日报社</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">中国企业科创力排行 家用电器 一 行业第一</span>
        <div class="item-source">南方周末</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 -->
    <div class="col col2">
      <div class="pill">ESG奖项</div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">入围财富中国ESG影响力榜</span>
        <div class="item-source">财富中国</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">福布斯中国2024可持续发展企业50强</span>
        <div class="item-source">福布斯中国</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">中国新增长ESG创新实践榜</span>
        <div class="item-source">哈佛商业评论</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">ESG新标杆企业奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">证券之星</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">年度低碳先锋</span>
        <div class="item-source">南方周末</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">ESG综合治理标杆企业</span>
        <div class="item-source">经济观察报</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">中国制造业上市公司社会责任五星金奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">时代责任四十人论坛</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">可持续品牌典范奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">虎嗅ESG</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">可持续发展优创奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">《电器》杂志社</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024中国最佳ESG雇主</span>
        <div class="item-source">怡安AON</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">杰出全球ESG影响力大奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">2024粤港澳大湾区可持续发展论坛暨香港ESG报告大奖（HERA）</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 -->
    <div class="col col3">
      <div class="pill">技术认可</div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024亚洲最佳移动技术突破奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">GSMA亚洲移动大奖（AMO）</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">国家科技进步奖二等奖（《空气源热泵多品位热能高效供应关键技术与应用》）</span>
        <div class="item-source">国务院</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">中国创新方法大赛一等奖（《基于TRIZ的干衣机低碳关键技术研究》项目）</span>
        <div class="item-source">中国科学技术协会、重庆市政府</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024年第三届高能团队奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">哈佛商业评论，北京国际人力资本集团股份有限公司</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024胡润中国元宇宙潜力企业榜</span>
        <div class="item-source">胡润研究院</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">美的集团联合项目《智能工厂全连接物流及精细化管理关键技术研究与应用》荣获了2024年度“机械工业科学技术奖”科技进步奖一等奖</span>
        <div class="item-source">中国机械工业联合会，中国机械工程学会</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024年度脉脉MAX雇主榜单</span>
        <div class="item-source">脉脉</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">2024绿点中国·可持续消费实践案例评选（美的集团-废旧家电绿色闭路循环创新项目）</span>
        <div class="item-source">第一财经</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 -->
    <div class="col col4">
      <div class="item" style="margin-top: 48px;">
        <span class="item-title">美的洗衣机合肥工厂被评为“可持续灯塔工厂”</span>
        <div class="item-source">世界经济论坛</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">美的医疗“中国脊梁守护计划”公益活动成功入选〔2024健康中国创新实践典型案例〕</span>
        <div class="item-source">人民网</div>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="item-title">美的医疗荣获2024年度中国新质发展优秀案例</span>
        <div class="item-source">国家广告研究院、《中国名牌》杂志社</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="trophy-placeholder">
    <div class="placeholder">[Illustration: blue trophy with laurel wreath, bottom-right corner]</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span>139</span>
    <span>140</span>
  </div>

</div>
